{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/288500/extras/fbc83f56c44847506c9615398a68c8ef.avif?t=1764236835\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the dangerous forest of Amazon in this immersive hidden-object puzzle adventure game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a dark curse ignites the jungle, a brave explorer must escape the burning Amazon village, explore lost temples, and uncover the truth behind the legendary Black Rainbow. If you love story-driven point-and-click adventures, this one\u2019s for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set on the journey and explore dozens of locations; forest, old temples, forgotten villages and much more. Use your surviving skills and techniques to escape the inevitable in this thrilling hidden object puzzle adventure game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/288500/extras/e12df74d49c83c2c80d6e0a9962cb16b.avif?t=1764236835\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Hidden Object &amp; Puzzle Adventure \u2013 investigate\u00a0 scenes and solve mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Dozens of locations &amp; mini-games \u2013 mystery lurks from every dark corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Map &amp; Journal \u2013 always know where to go next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Full voiceovers &amp; HD visuals \u2013 immerse yourself in the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f 3 difficulty levels \u2013 from relaxed exploration to true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf4 Play completely offline \u2014 anytime, anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd12 No data collection \u2014 your privacy is safe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click / Tap to search scenes, collect clues, combine items from your inventory, and complete mini-games to progress the story. Use hints if you get stuck \u2014 but the reward is uncovering more of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Play your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, investigate and solve the mystery in your own way: adjustable challenge: Casual, Adventure, and Challenging difficulty modes. Win Achievements &amp; Collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Atmospheric adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping mystery: narrative-driven gameplay with a strong detective lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive locations: explore, seeks, search and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/288500/extras/02555f5fbc5e626b0a361c2a8941025a.avif?t=1764236835\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > FIND your way out of the dark forest of Amazon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > INVESTIGATE mysterious and unusual locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > FIND useful hidden objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > SEARCH through dozens of hidden and sacred places</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > HELP people of Amazon to stop the darkness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > SOLVE dozens of exciting mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > WIN achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > READ the diary as your ADVENTURE continues</p></li></ul>","achievements":{